    "originalPrint": "Original Printed Textbook Content:\nNephron structural segments: Bowman's capsule with podocytes encasing glomerular capillaries. Proximal Convoluted Tubule (PCT: reabsorbs 65-70% of filtered water, sodium, potassium, and 100% of glucose and amino acids). Loop of Henle: thin descending limb permeable to water; thick ascending limb impermeable to water with Na-K-2Cl cotransporter (inhibited by Loop Diuretics like Furosemide).",
