    "originalPrint": "Original Printed Textbook Content:\nPharmacology fundamentals: Pharmacokinetics (Absorption, Distribution, Metabolism, Excretion - what body does to drug) vs Pharmacodynamics (receptor binding, biochemical effects - what drug does to body). Autonomic receptors: Alpha-1 (vasoconstriction), Beta-1 (increased heart rate and contractility), Beta-2 (bronchodilation and skeletal muscle vasodilation), Muscarinic cholinergic receptors (stimulated by Pilocarpine to promote salivary secretion).",
