    "originalPrint": "Original Printed Textbook Content:\nProphylaxis requirement breakdown: REQUIRED for dental procedures involving manipulation of gingival tissue or periapical region or perforation of oral mucosa (tooth extractions, periodontal scaling/root planing, subgingival placement of bands/cords, implant placement, periapical endodontic instrumentation). NOT REQUIRED for routine local anesthetic injections through non-infected tissue, taking dental radiographs, placing removable appliances/brackets, or shedding of primary teeth.",
